  "summary": "Container\nContainer freight rates were a mixed bag over the past week. The FBX Weighted Average decreased by 17 points from 3,514 at the end of last week, ending this week at 3,497. The major trade lane from Asia into the US West Coast (FBX01) saw rates increasing by USD176, from USD8,342 at the end of last week, ending this week at USD8,518 per FEU.",
